{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phantomware</strong> is an episodic psychological horror game where overtime shifts turn into something far more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More episodes coming soon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PHANTOMWARE: 0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re working late, testing a mysterious game for a shady client, but as glitches appear and messages grow unsettling, you start to question what\u2019s real. The game\u2019s eerie presence spreads beyond the screen, with the mysterious virus connecting the digital and physical worlds. Cryptic clues and strange occurrences lead you deeper into a chilling mystery, where the boundary between reality and the game starts to collapse. You soon start realizing that there might be no escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photo-realistic visuals</strong> with an eerie atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS aesthetic</strong> for a retro horror feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Text messaging</strong>\u00a0receive and reply messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel OS</strong>\u00a0a fully interactive mini operating system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-games</strong>\u00a0but not all are safe to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/extras/Join_Our_Discord.png?t=1745048751\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432440?t=1745048751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/efa2efa6593452571bf33630273ccf74ef8a76cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745048751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432440/875a032f8a207b6105d82dca94a9bea97ba5c1c7/capsule_231x87